{"id":"n32488-1-9","stage":2,"title":"기념품 · 纪念品","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32488-1-9-1","ko":"이 열쇠고리 예쁘다! 어디서 샀어?","zh":"这个钥匙扣真漂亮！是在哪儿买的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열쇠고리","meaning":"钥匙环，钥匙扣","explanation":"열쇠고리：钥匙环，钥匙扣","readings":[{"term":"열쇠고리","audio":"/audio/6e46e6f4d39978901024.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20838","senseId":"1","lemma":"열쇠고리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘다!","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6e46e6f4d3997890","term":"열쇠고리","zh":"钥匙环，钥匙扣","audio":"/audio/6e46e6f4d39978901024.mp3","entryId":"20838","definition":"扣上保管钥匙的物体。","pronunciation":["열ː쐬고리","열ː쒜고리"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd8dc73e7df07b0ea495.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32488-1-9-2","ko":"아빠가 프랑스에 출장을 다녀오시면서 기념품으로 사다 주셨어.","zh":"爸爸去法国出差的时候，买回来当作纪念品送给我的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠가","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프랑스에","meaning":"法国","explanation":"프랑스：法国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"프랑스에","audio":"/audio/f5ba3479b45279e19697.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"출장을","meaning":"出差","explanation":"출장：出差；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"출장","audio":"/audio/9750a26dc02fab9dfd46.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72144","senseId":"1","lemma":"출장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀오시면서","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기념품으로","meaning":"纪念品","explanation":"기념품：纪念品；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"기념품","audio":"/audio/637789a1be3ec898914c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32488","senseId":"1","lemma":"기념품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사다","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셨어.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"9750a26dc02fab9d","term":"출장","zh":"出差","audio":"/audio/9750a26dc02fab9dfd46.mp3","entryId":"72144","definition":"暂时到外地办理公事。","pronunciation":["출짱"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"637789a1be3ec898","term":"기념품","zh":"纪念品","audio":"/audio/637789a1be3ec898914c.mp3","entryId":"32488","definition":"为留作纪念而赠送或购买的物品。","pronunciation":["기념품"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ab7fd1b37efdde19dc1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32488","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["爸爸去法国出差的时候，买回来当作纪念品送给我的。","这个钥匙扣真漂亮！是在哪儿买的呀？","最近流感很流行呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个钥匙扣真漂亮！是在哪儿买的呀？","最近流感很流行呢。","爸爸去法国出差的时候，买回来当作纪念品送给我的。"],"answer":2}]}
